+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mThe grid is a 2D array of single-character strings:[39m                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- `'S'` — beam source (always on the top row). Emits a beam straight down.[39m                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- `'^'` — splitter. When a beam arrives, it splits into two diagonal beams.[39m                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- `'.'` — empty cell. Beams pass through.[39m                                                                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mBeams that leave the grid boundaries are absorbed (they stop).[39m                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Beam Movement Rules[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m1. A beam from the source `'S'` moves **straight down** (row+1, same column) each step.[39m                                                                                                                                   [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m2. When a beam hits a splitter `'^'`, it splits into **two beams**:[39m                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m   - One goes **down-left** (row+1, col-1)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m   - One goes **down-right** (row+1, col+1)[39m                                                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m   The original beam is consumed by the splitter (it does not continue straight).[39m                                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m3. An unsplit beam (not at a splitter) continues in its current direction:[39m                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m   - A downward beam continues downward (row+1, same col)[39m                                                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m   - A down-left beam continues down-left (row+1, col-1)[39m                                                                                                                                                                  [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m   - A down-right beam continues down-right (row+1, col+1)[39m                                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m4. A beam is **absorbed** when it moves outside the grid boundaries (row < 0, row >= rows, col < 0, col >= cols).[39m                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m5. Multiple beams can occupy the same cell simultaneously.[39m                                                                                                                                                                [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m6. Splitters always split regardless of the beam's incoming direction.[39m                                                                                                                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## API[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [49m
